<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T12:00:00.000+01:00" lasteditedby="Copilot" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>SET SEPARATOR Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET SEPARATOR command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET SEPARATOR Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Purpose</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">Specifies the character that is used to separate groups of digits (the thousands separator) in numeric expressions.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Syntax</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET SEPARATOR TO [&lt;cCharacter&gt;]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Arguments</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;cCharacter&gt;<tab />The thousands separator. When the character is omitted the separator is reset to the comma (",").</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Remarks</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">The setting is stored in the runtime state as Set.Separator, which is the same setting as the one that is changed by <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetThousandSep.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetThousandSep()</link>.</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">See Also</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_POINT">SET POINT</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_DECIMALS">SET DECIMALS</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetThousandSep.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetThousandSep()</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
